Hello,

You are receiving this email as you a member of ATG's Client Engagement team and have access to our internal Salesforce CRM Data.

In the past several weeks you may have noticed a new button on our Salesforce login screen titled "Microsoft Single Sign-On". This feature will allow you to log into our Salesforce instance with your Office 365 credentials, replacing the security need for the Salesforce Multi-factor authentication app. You can choose to log in using this new feature, or with your standard username, password, and MFA app on your phone.

The ISO team is in the process of configuring this feature for our Atlas community and working towards simplifying user experience for logging into our Salesforce products for all ATG'ers. Expect further communication in this regard.

If you run into issues with the Single Sign-On feature, please reach out to the ISO team at internalsf@atginfo.com.

Thanks,
Casey